<h1>Claude</h1>

<p><b>Claude</b> is an artificial intelligence chatbot developed by Anthropic, designed to generate human-like text and assist with a wide range of tasks such as writing, answering questions, and reasoning.</p>

<p>It is part of a family of large language models focused on safety, alignment, and helpful interactions.</p>

<hr/>

<h2>Background</h2>

<p>Claude was created by Anthropic, an AI research company focused on building reliable and interpretable artificial intelligence systems.</p>

<p>The model is trained using large datasets and refined with techniques designed to improve safety and accuracy.</p>

