<h2>Capabilities</h2>

<p>Claude can perform a variety of tasks including generating text, summarizing information, answering questions, and assisting with coding.</p>

<p>It is designed to handle long conversations and complex instructions while maintaining context.</p>

<hr/>

<h2>Design and Safety</h2>

<p>Claude emphasizes safety and alignment, using techniques such as constitutional AI to guide its responses and reduce harmful outputs.</p>

<p>It aims to provide helpful, honest, and harmless responses in interactions.</p>

<hr/>

<h2>Uses</h2>

<ul>
<li>Writing and editing text</li>
<li>Answering questions</li>
<li>Coding assistance</li>
<li>Research and summarization</li>
<li>Brainstorming ideas</li>
</ul>

