<h2>Impact</h2>

<p>Claude is part of the growing field of conversational AI and contributes to how people interact with technology, especially in writing, education, and software development.</p>

<p>It is often compared with other AI assistants in terms of performance, safety, and usability.</p>

<hr/>

<h2>Limitations</h2>

<p>Like other AI systems, Claude can produce incorrect or incomplete information and does not possess real understanding or consciousness.</p>

<p>Its responses depend on the input it receives and the data it was trained on.</p>

